5,1,1,talk,May,,I refuse to sign anything that keeps the bin at one gate forever.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,The smell in August is unbearable. We need a solution that works daily.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about the cost. Who pays for the new shelter?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,I just want us to be able to talk to each other again.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must measure the burden before we agree to carry it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, cost is fine if the placement is fair.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, talking helps, but the odor is a health issue.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, exactly. We need the numbers to see who pays what.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, I agree. But let's not let anger drive the choice.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, yes. I will look into the ledger and the subsidy.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I want to see the frontage measurements. That decides fairness.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will check the complaint log and the station block minutes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the block ledger and the ward subsidy.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will check the residents' meeting statements and the truck time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the ward filing requirements and the shelter costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Let's see what the data says before we commit.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Facts over feelings.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I hope the numbers show a fair split.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we can still share a meal afterwards.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,May the truth guide our hands.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
