35,2,1,talk,May,,The logs show one household filed eleven of fourteen complaints.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,That confirms my suspicion. The current setup is failing that neighbor.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The ledger shows we spend thirty-four thousand yen a year on extra fees.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Midori,,The truck comes at seven forty. That is before I am even awake.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The clerk says a permanent build needs four months and five signatures.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, thirty-four thousand is a lot. But is it fair?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, seven forty is early. We need a time that works for all.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, four months is long. Can we do something temporary first?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, if the truck is early, maybe we rotate the duty?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, temporary is wise. But we must know the true cost of keeping it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,The frontage data is clear. One house has a driveway blocking the bay.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The station block minutes show they fought over the latch within two years.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"The subsidy covers forty percent. That helps, but the rest is on us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The statements show people want to help, but they are afraid to ask.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"The shelter cost is high. We must budget for maintenance, not just building.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,We cannot ignore the driveway issue. It changes the math.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,We must avoid the station block's mistake. We need a clear rule.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I think we should look at a shared fund for the maintenance.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Midori,,I think we should choose a time that lets us all sleep.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,I think we should choose the option that asks the least of our daily lives.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
